OHOS: separates `openharmony-arm64`, bundled-runtime, and model/library
directory resolution, with model hash verification kept intact. Drop a
resource-root diagnostic log and an executable-name branch that can never
run once OHOS is known to be `bundled=true`; restore the stable
`store_runtime_invalid` error id rather than interpolating diagnostic detail
into it, to avoid breaking the existing error-string mapping. The runtime
manifest check now verifies the actual loaded `libsnow_ocr_inprocess.so`
instead of a stand-in for the removed out-of-process worker.

